Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 13:22:41 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(mobile): Phase C2 live call signalling (ringing, answer,
 decline, hang-up)

- socket.io signalling client with a fresh one-time ticket per connection
- pure call state machine + 24 node checks (npm run test:calls)
- CallProvider: connection lifecycle, call:sync on reconnect/foreground,
  ringtone and vibration, orphaned accepted calls are ended
- full-screen CallOverlay above any screen: incoming call, outgoing,
  active timer, ended summary with the reason
- Directory and Calls screens start real calls; history refreshes after
- redacted leadership callers show only the server's label
- no audio yet (AUDIO_ENABLED=false); WebRTC is Phase C3

